# LIQUID-03 — Avoid unscoped global collection lookups

## Rationale

`all_products`, bare `collections`, and `linklists` are expensive global objects.
Prefer a scoped section setting (a specific collection/product) instead.

## How to check

```bash
bun "<skill-dir>/scripts/cli.ts" check liquid-performance <file>
```

Flags these global lookups.

## How to fix

Propose driving the data from a section/block setting (collection picker, product
reference, or dynamic source).

## Examples

### Bad

```liquid
{% for product in collections.all.products limit: 4 %}
  ...
{% endfor %}
```

### Good

```liquid
{% assign featured = section.settings.featured_collection %}
{% if featured != blank %}
  {% for product in featured.products limit: section.settings.limit %}
    ...
  {% endfor %}
{% endif %}
```
